Chromium cursor resources
=========================

The cursor files under assets/cursors are base64-encoded copies of official
Chromium cursor resources:

https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/ui/resources/cursors/

They are used for Windows drag and browser autoscroll cursor bridges.
Chromium source files are distributed under the BSD 3-Clause license:

https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/refs/heads/main/LICENSE

